          "id": "1046656a-f03a-4c16-96ad-3995ab5751f4",
          "memory": "Alex bought a tiny basil plant on September 20, 2026 from the little nursery by the grocery store for $3.50 off a $3 herb table. It has only three fingernail-sized leaves in a thimble/shot-glass-sized pot smaller than his mug, coffee spoon, house keys, and key fob.",
