        },
        {
          "id": "8c993457-d647-4993-be09-5014012663c2",
          "memory": "Alex put the tiny basil on his windowsill next to his succulent on September 20, 2026, watered it with a tablespoon and worried he almost drowned it, and gives it a 50/50 chance because his windowsill gets weird sun, planning to repot if it survives the week and joking he will make pesto in 10 years.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c5e8e04b-fd9b-41f4-b34e-c0b0dea09b69",
          "memory": "On the afternoon of September 20, 2026 User was doing laundry with the washer going and dryer beeping while camped on the floor because the couch was covered, and Alex said he still had a pile of shirts on his chair.",
