        {
          "id": "278bf925-4c9d-4619-8b20-fe3fad8120ce",
          "memory": "On September 20, 2026 User caught the second half of the game and discussed with Alex a wild call in the 4th; Alex said he yelled and scared his new tiny basil, which is so light the pot moved when he sneezed.",
          "event": "ADD"
